ption_size":12,"price_size":18,"margin_top":16,"margin_bottom":16}},"sticky_atc":{"type":"sticky_atc","settings":{"function":"add_to_cart","display_when":"after_scroll","button_label":"Add to cart","star_color":"#ffcc00","stars_label":"(xxxx Reviews)","picker_type":"combined","color_scheme":"scheme-1","desktop_show_image":true,"desktop_show_title":true,"desktop_rating_stars":true,"desktop_show_price":true,"desktop_show_sale_badge":true,"desktop_variant_picker":true,"desktop_show_price_in_button":true,"mobile_show_image":false,"mobile_show_title":true,"mobile_rating_stars":false,"mobile_show_price":true,"mobile_show_sale_badge":true,"mobile_variant_picker":false,"mobile_show_price_in_button":false}},"description":{"type":"description","settings":{}},"collapsible_tab_R9VbPN":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"1. Shipping & Delivery","icon":"none","content":"<p><strong>Processing Time<\/strong><br\/><br\/>Orders are carefully prepared within <strong>1–3 business days<\/strong> before shipment.<\/p><p><strong>Estimated Delivery<\/strong><br\/><br\/>Delivery time begins once your order has shipped and may vary depending on your destination and fulfillment location.<\/p><ul><li><strong>United States:<\/strong> Most orders arrive within <strong>7–9 business days<\/strong> after shipment. Selected items fulfilled from a U.S. location may arrive faster, typically within <strong>2–5 business days<\/strong>.<br\/><\/li><li><strong>Europe:<\/strong> Approximately <strong>5–8 business days<\/strong>.<br\/><\/li><li><strong>Other International Destinations:<\/strong> Approximately <strong>10–15 business days<\/strong>.<br\/><\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Fully Tracked Delivery<\/strong><br\/><br\/>Once your order ships, you’ll receive a confirmation email with tracking information so you can follow your package from our workshop to your door.<\/p><p>Please note that delivery dates are estimates. Holidays, peak seasons, customs clearance, severe weather, remote locations, or unexpected carrier delays may occasionally affect transit times.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_tab_bQtHA8":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"2. Returns & Refunds","icon":"none","content":"<p>We want you to feel confident shopping with <strong>ToneGift<\/strong>.<\/p><p>If you receive an item that is <strong>damaged, defective, incorrect, or significantly different from what you ordered<\/strong>, please contact us as soon as possible at <a href=\"mailto:support@tonegift.com\"><strong>support@tonegift.com<\/strong><\/a> with your order number and clear photos of the issue.<\/p><p>Eligible items may be returned within <strong>30 days of delivery<\/strong> in accordance with our Return & Refund Policy.<\/p><p>For approved returns, <strong>return shipping is free<\/strong> and there is <strong>no restocking fee<\/strong>. We will provide return instructions and, where applicable, a prepaid return shipping label.<\/p><p>Once your return is received and inspected, we will notify you of the approval status. If approved, your refund will be issued to your <strong>original payment method within 10 business days<\/strong>. Your bank or payment provider may require additional time for the refund to appear in your account.<\/p><p>Original shipping charges are generally non-refundable unless the return is due to a <strong>damaged, defective, incorrect, or improperly fulfilled order<\/strong>.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_tab_EUBVLi":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"3. Quality Guarantee","icon":"none","content":"<p>Every <strong>ToneGift<\/strong> hat is carefully inspected before shipment for overall appearance, embroidery quality, stitching, and construction.<\/p><p>Because embroidered products are made with fabric and thread, <strong>small variations in stitch placement, thread texture, embroidery density, or color tone may naturally occur<\/strong>. These minor differences are normal characteristics of the embroidery process and do not affect the overall quality or functionality of the product.<\/p><p>If your item arrives with a <strong>manufacturing defect, significant embroidery issue, damage, or other quality concern<\/strong>, please contact us at <a href=\"mailto:support@tonegift.com\"><strong>support@tonegift.com<\/strong><\/a> with your order number and clear photos of the issue.<\/p><p>Our support team will review your request and, when appropriate, provide a suitable solution such as a replacement or refund in accordance with our Return & Refund Policy.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_tab_qkyPcr":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"4. Product Care","icon":"none","content":"<p>To help maintain the shape, color, and embroidery quality of your <strong>ToneGift<\/strong> hat, we recommend the following care instructions:<\/p><ul><li><strong>Spot clean or hand wash whenever possible<\/strong><\/li><li>Use <strong>cold or lukewarm water<\/strong><\/li><li>Use a mild detergent and avoid harsh cleaning chemicals<\/li><li><strong>Do not bleach<\/strong><\/li><li><strong>Do not machine wash or tumble dry<\/strong><\/li><li>Allow the hat to <strong>air dry naturally<\/strong><\/li><li>Avoid excessive heat and prolonged exposure to direct sunlight<\/li><li><strong>Do not iron directly over embroidered areas<\/strong><\/li><li>Avoid twisting, wringing, or crushing the hat while wet<\/li><\/ul><p>Proper care will help preserve the hat’s structure, color, stitching, and embroidered details for longer.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_tab_VVcyDk":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"5. Contact & Support","icon":"none","content":"<p>Need help with your order, sizing, shipping, or product information?<\/p><p>Our support team is happy to help.<\/p><p>When contacting us about an existing order, please include your <strong>order number and the email address used at checkout<\/strong> so we can assist you more quickly.<\/p><p><\/p>","page":""}},"reviews":{"type":"reviews","disabled":true,"sett